{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/header.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You awaken in the remnants of an ancient Ardent Protectorate facility</strong>, long abandoned and overgrown. The Aetherium Nexus\u2014once the heart of the planet\u2019s defenses\u2014lies dormant. Without it, the Eldran corruption spreads unchecked, defiling the land and consuming its magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft powerful gear</strong>, experiment with <strong>unlimited spell combinations</strong>, unleash your creativity  by casting spells that <strong>alter the landscape </strong>forever. Harness the power of the Aetherium network, <strong>unlocking new powers\u00a0</strong>and forging your own path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle twisted creatures, challenge legendary bosses, and uncover ancient secrets.</strong> Whether you\u2019re  braving the unknown solo, or thriving in co-op with friends, every adventure is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/ExploreWorld.gif?t=1744703989\" /><strong>Dig tunnels, sculpt intricate statues, or level entire mountains</strong> with nothing but a shovel and determination. Spells and abilities shape the terrain in dynamic ways, bombs and pyroblasts leave smoldering craters, while the Tome of Ice lets you walk across canyons on a frozen bridge of your own making. If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bend the elements to your will, this is your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/EmpowerAetherium.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Wilds and restore its defenses by powering ancient Aetherium facilities\u2014each one unlocking new upgrades and paths. Travel the land via Aether Rays, strategically activating abilities in this vast, physical talent tree. Will you master its full potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/BuildBase.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials to construct and upgrade your base. <strong>Craft powerful armor and weapons</strong> at your specialized stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your dream fantasy home with a wide range of furniture and decorations, or elevate your journey by <strong>growing crops</strong>, <strong>cooking delicious meals</strong>, and <strong>brewing powerful elixirs</strong> to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/DiscoverTreasure.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture deep into  caves and ancient underground fortresses, where danger lurks around every corner. As you explore these dark, labyrinthine caverns, you'll face deadly traps, fierce enemies, and hidden secrets waiting to be uncovered. But the risk is worth the reward\u2014valuable loot, rare materials, and powerful artifacts lie buried within, ready for those brave enough to claim them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/EquipChar.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge powerful armor and weapons at your crafting stations, using materials you've gathered along your journey. Alternatively, some of the best gear can be looted from your fallen foes. Whether you craft or conquer, each piece of equipment will enhance your strength and prepare you for even greater challenges ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/DefeatBosses.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to face off against epic bosses in intense, heart-pounding battles that will test your skills and strategy. You'll need to bring your best gear, abilities, and teamwork to stand a chance. Victory comes with rich rewards\u2014defeating these mighty adversaries grants you access to legendary loot, rare items, and powerful weapons that can greatly enhance your abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/PlayWithFriends.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ardent Wilds offers online co-op for up to 6 players*, letting you and your friends explore and conquer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Player count can be increased beyond 6, though the game is not balanced for larger groups.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive modding capabilities: all game objects, creatures, abilities and combat effects are programmable using our Lua API. Need some examples? All scripts for our existing content is shipped with the game and is visible and accessible for you to tinker with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your hero with a myriad of hair styles, beards, colors &amp; other customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No internet? No problem! The game can be played in multiplayer over the Local Network (LAN) as well as Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2275010?t=1744703989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744703989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/47487fc8de3e8d6b53696d1c3018a033ccf57bde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744703989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/47487fc8de3e8d6b53696d1c3018a033ccf57bde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744703989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/header.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You awaken in the remnants of an ancient Ardent Protectorate facility</strong>, long abandoned and overgrown. The Aetherium Nexus\u2014once the heart of the planet\u2019s defenses\u2014lies dormant. Without it, the Eldran corruption spreads unchecked, defiling the land and consuming its magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft powerful gear</strong>, experiment with <strong>unlimited spell combinations</strong>, unleash your creativity  by casting spells that <strong>alter the landscape </strong>forever. Harness the power of the Aetherium network, <strong>unlocking new powers\u00a0</strong>and forging your own path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle twisted creatures, challenge legendary bosses, and uncover ancient secrets.</strong> Whether you\u2019re  braving the unknown solo, or thriving in co-op with friends, every adventure is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/ExploreWorld.gif?t=1744703989\" /><strong>Dig tunnels, sculpt intricate statues, or level entire mountains</strong> with nothing but a shovel and determination. Spells and abilities shape the terrain in dynamic ways, bombs and pyroblasts leave smoldering craters, while the Tome of Ice lets you walk across canyons on a frozen bridge of your own making. If you\u2019ve ever wanted to bend the elements to your will, this is your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/EmpowerAetherium.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Wilds and restore its defenses by powering ancient Aetherium facilities\u2014each one unlocking new upgrades and paths. Travel the land via Aether Rays, strategically activating abilities in this vast, physical talent tree. Will you master its full potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/BuildBase.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials to construct and upgrade your base. <strong>Craft powerful armor and weapons</strong> at your specialized stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your dream fantasy home with a wide range of furniture and decorations, or elevate your journey by <strong>growing crops</strong>, <strong>cooking delicious meals</strong>, and <strong>brewing powerful elixirs</strong> to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/DiscoverTreasure.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture deep into  caves and ancient underground fortresses, where danger lurks around every corner. As you explore these dark, labyrinthine caverns, you'll face deadly traps, fierce enemies, and hidden secrets waiting to be uncovered. But the risk is worth the reward\u2014valuable loot, rare materials, and powerful artifacts lie buried within, ready for those brave enough to claim them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/EquipChar.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge powerful armor and weapons at your crafting stations, using materials you've gathered along your journey. Alternatively, some of the best gear can be looted from your fallen foes. Whether you craft or conquer, each piece of equipment will enhance your strength and prepare you for even greater challenges ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/DefeatBosses.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to face off against epic bosses in intense, heart-pounding battles that will test your skills and strategy. You'll need to bring your best gear, abilities, and teamwork to stand a chance. Victory comes with rich rewards\u2014defeating these mighty adversaries grants you access to legendary loot, rare items, and powerful weapons that can greatly enhance your abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/PlayWithFriends.gif?t=1744703989\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ardent Wilds offers online co-op for up to 6 players*, letting you and your friends explore and conquer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Player count can be increased beyond 6, though the game is not balanced for larger groups.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275010/extras/separator.png?t=1744703989\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive modding capabilities: all game objects, creatures, abilities and combat effects are programmable using our Lua API. Need some examples? All scripts for our existing content is shipped with the game and is visible and accessible for you to tinker with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your hero with a myriad of hair styles, beards, colors &amp; other customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No internet? No problem! The game can be played in multiplayer over the Local Network (LAN) as well as Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Spellware Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_im